},
{
"p": 8,
"t": "“Don’t worry,” she says.",
"s": 49.09
},
{
"p": 8,
"t": "“You can do it. On Thursday evening, we can practice together.”",
"s": 50.68
},
{
"p": 9,
"t": "A week has seven days, but this week, I only think about one day: Friday!",
"s": 55.05
}
